{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S02、S04、S13等段的感受短语仍然偏密，部分到时出现的内容可能来不及细看；尤其S13的“就算听到保证”与“刚刚答了声是”之间，叙事因果略显含混，X在这方面更稳。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段心理变化的关键抓手，感受文字又小一层，并通过到时出现让音乐变化与情绪细节形成对应，扫读时更容易抓住主线。水波、船身、漂浮、失去支撑到最后定住的意象反复回扣，使前后更像同一段完整经历；具体的声音、身体和情绪变化也比X细腻。X的叙述在解释人物动机和因果关系上更直接完整，但感受词有些泛化、重复，整体体验的精细程度不如Y。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4ebbbe9f-77d8-4106-950f-c461d20a0e04", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T230654344119Z", "elapsed_seconds": 95.469, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:08:29.818138+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7e508b97440d52e1ce156b55944c57adcaf62f3c653562ad0cdf4250be0b8f3b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "too